    <node id="&quot;VIỆT NAM DÂN CHỦ CỘNG HÒA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">""&lt;SEP&gt;"Chính phủ Việt Nam Dân chủ Cộng hòa được thành lập sau khi giành độc lập; tham gia vào giai đoạn hình thành và phát triển của nước Việt Nam độc lập."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chính quyền Việt Nam Dân chủ Cộng hòa (VNDCCH), chính quyền miền Bắc trước khi thống nhất năm 1975–1976."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chính quyền/nhà nước miền Bắc Việt Nam, VNDCCH; ra quyết định chỉ đạo lực lượng vũ trang miền Nam chuyển sang chiến tranh vũ trang qua Nghị quyết Trung ương 15."&lt;SEP&gt;"North Vietnam; government in the north during the Vietnam War."&lt;SEP&gt;"The North Vietnamese government led by the Communist movement, backed by China and the Soviet Union, managing the northern region with Hanoi as the capital and pursuing land reform; referenced in discussions of the 1950s and the Geneva outcomes."&lt;SEP&gt;"The state proclaimed on 2 September 1945 in Hanoi, founding the modern Vietnamese state."&lt;SEP&gt;"North Vietnam's government; backed by China and the Soviet Union; associated with the Viet Minh movement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Democratic Republic of Vietnam, proclaimed in 1945 and leading the resistance against colonial forces."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Democratic Republic of Vietnam, proclaimed on September 2, 1945."&lt;SEP&gt;"Việt Nam Dân chủ Cộng hòa (VNDCCH), the government of North Vietnam during the Vietnam War."&lt;SEP&gt;"North Vietnam’s government; in 1959, directed the South’s secret armed forces to wage an armed campaign to overthrow Diệm via Central Resolution 15."&lt;SEP&gt;"Proclaimed independence in 1945; led by Hồ Chí Minh; controlled most of the country."&lt;SEP&gt;"State proclaimed on September 2, 1945 in Hanoi; also known as VNDCCH."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Democratic Republic of Vietnam, the state proclaimed during the early postwar period and the main government body leading the resistance in the First Indochina War."&lt;SEP&gt;"The government of the northern part of Vietnam, led by Ho Chi Minh, governing the North during the division of Vietnam; officially referred to as VNDCCH in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"1950"&lt;|"The government formed after World War II in Vietnam and later gained diplomatic recognition in 1950; it was a central political actor in the Indochina War, aligned with China and the USSR."&lt;SEP&gt;"North Vietnam's socialist government."&lt;SEP&gt;"The state proclaimed on 2 September 1945 in Hanoi, representing Việt Minh, and serving as the foundational government in early Vietnamese independence."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vietnamese Democratic Republic; northern Vietnamese government, supported by China and the Soviet Union, fought French forces."&lt;SEP&gt;"Việt Nam Dân chủ Cộng hòa (Bắc Việt) là quốc gia được thành lập năm 1945 và lãnh đạo bởi Hồ Chí Minh trong cuộc kháng chiến."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Democratic Republic of Vietnam, proclaimed after the August Revolution in 1945."&lt;SEP&gt;"The government established after the August Revolution, representing the new state formed in Vietnam's 1945 upheaval."&lt;SEP&gt;"The republic proclaimed in the independence movement; referenced by slogans and in the political transition context."&lt;SEP&gt;"The state proclaimed by Ho Chi Minh at the 2 September 1945 ceremony, signaling the birth of a new Vietnam."&lt;SEP&gt;"The state proclaimed on September 2, 1945 after the August Revolution; later organized elections in 1946."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-0e1e11930ab01fb061749acffe85b755&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18d8e97a0e4680cead04b467abbaf21b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf0b29bf76d345dfa9da0349d9f546d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4549a0a33a97f39084dfcd2d857e18f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fff36ca9411ec2bf48b0a366dd7589f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0858721f576cf19954031c342a7d2bff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6322ad53528ea4e193eaf9be34d2898&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dae09351baefd2c96da656733c534ccd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ebc4b0a454e2ea3adc019759de704c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43ffd57cec3dd07166a619a76148c755&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c715893072e90e3f1536ec249629f939</data>
      <data key="d3">1945&lt;SEP&gt;1945"&lt;SEP&gt;1946&lt;SEP&gt;1950"&lt;SEP&gt;1954&lt;SEP&gt;1959</data>
      <data key="d4">DRV&lt;SEP&gt;NORTH VIETNAM&lt;SEP&gt;VIỆT NAM&lt;SEP&gt;VIỆT NAM DÂN CHỦ CỘNG HÒA&lt;SEP&gt;VNDCCH</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;VIỆT NAM CỘNG HÒA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Chính quyền miền Nam Việt Nam (VNCH); sụp đổ hoàn toàn sau đợt tiến công của Quân đội nhân dân Việt Nam vào ngày 30 tháng 4 năm 1975."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chính thể VNCH ở Nam Việt Nam; bị QĐNDVN và Quân Giải phóng miền Nam đánh bại và sụp đổ."&lt;SEP&gt;"South Vietnam's anti-communist state established under Ngô Đình Diệm, with its capital in Saigon; allied with the United States and positioned in opposition to the VNDCCH."&lt;SEP&gt;"South Vietnam; government in the south during the Vietnam War."&lt;SEP&gt;"South Vietnam; anti-communist state formed after renaming Quốc gia Việt Nam to Việt Nam Cộng hòa."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Republic of Vietnam, anti-communist state backed by the United States during the Vietnam War."&lt;SEP&gt;"Việt Nam Cộng hòa (VNCH), the government of South Vietnam during the Vietnam War; collapsed in 1975 after the North Vietnamese offensive."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Republic of Vietnam, the anti-communist state in the south established after the 1955 reorganization; its capital was in Saigon (Sài Gòn)."#"&lt;SEP&gt;"US-backed South Vietnam during the Vietnam War."&lt;SEP&gt;"Republic of Vietnam (South Vietnam); renamed from the State of Vietnam in 1955 and led by Ngô Đình Diệm."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Republic of Vietnam (South Vietnam); did not sign the Geneva Accords of 1954."&lt;SEP&gt;"Việt Nam Cộng hòa (Nam Việt Nam) là quốc gia đồng minh của Hoa Kỳ."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4549a0a33a97f39084dfcd2d857e18f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e1e11930ab01fb061749acffe85b755&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c715893072e90e3f1536ec249629f939&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43ffd57cec3dd07166a619a76148c755</data>
