    <node id="&quot;CAMPUCHIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">""&lt;SEP&gt;"Cambodia; integrated into Indochina after 1887."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cambodia; modern Nam Á-speaking group referenced in genetic context."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cambodia; neighboring country along Vietnam's land border."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cambodia; referenced as a region over which Nguyễn Ánh extended political and military influence."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cambodia; region involved in later Vietnamese regional conflicts."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chiến tranh cũng lan rộng sang Campuchia."&lt;SEP&gt;"Neighboring country where Khmer Rouge ruled and where Vietnam conducted a campaign."&lt;SEP&gt;"Neighboring country; involved in Vietnam's border conflicts along the southwestern front (1978–1989)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Quốc gia láng giềng có chiến sự liên quan đến Việt Nam, chiến dịch phản công sang Campuchia diễn ra cuối năm 1978."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cambodia, site of later border conflicts with Vietnam."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cambodia; Vietnam's military presence as part of an international duty in Cambodia from 1979 to 1989; part of the broader Vietnam–Cambodia and regional security context."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cambodia; neighboring country to Vietnam; war spillover into Campuchia."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cambodian people; referenced among Nam Á-speaking populations in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"Campuchia (Cambodia), involved as the site of Vietnam's border conflict in the late 1970s to late 1980s."&lt;SEP&gt;"Campuchia (Cambodia), neighbor of Vietnam; site of Khmer Rouge actions and Vietnamese cross-border campaigns."&lt;SEP&gt;"Campuchia is Vietnam's neighbor along the land border and is referenced as involved in territorial disputes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Country of Cambodia, neighbor to Vietnam."&lt;SEP&gt;"Historical kingdom in Southeast Asia; mentioned as a region where Nguyễn Ánh's influence extended."&lt;SEP&gt;"Kingdom of Cambodia; later part of Indochina Federation.""&lt;SEP&gt;"Cambodia, Vietnam's neighbor along the land border; involved in territorial sovereignty disputes with Vietnam along the border."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cambodia, referenced in the context of Vietnam's border conflicts."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cambodia, where Vietnam deployed troops for about a decade (1979–1989) as part of international duties."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cambodia; part of French Indochina, later fully integrated in 1893."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cambodia; referenced as part of the Nam Á-language-speaking groups."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cambodia; region affected by the war’s spillover."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cambodia; site of border conflicts with Vietnam."&lt;SEP&gt;"Campuchia; Nguyễn Ánh extended political and military influence there."&lt;SEP&gt;"Country of Cambodia; site of the Cambodian conflict with the Khmer Rouge."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cambodia, mentioned as part of regional dynamics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cambodia, where Vietnamese troops were stationed as part of international obligation from 1979 to 1989."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cambodia; Southeast Asian country referenced in discussing Khmer polities and the Khmer Empire in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cambodia; khu vực biên giới với Việt Nam; bị Viêt Nam mở chiến dịch phản công cuối năm 1978."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cambodia; site of the Vietnam War-era border conflict from 1978 to 1989."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cambodia; the war spillover extended into this country."&lt;SEP&gt;"Campuchia is a neighboring country along the Vietnam border involved in territorial disputes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Campuchia là khu vực lân cận Việt Nam; vùng này có liên quan đến cuộc chiến Nam tiến và chiến tranh biên giới Tây-Nam."&lt;SEP&gt;"Kingdom of Cambodia annexed into Indochina under French influence; later incorporated into the federation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vùng biên giới phía Tây Nam Việt Nam; nơi diễn ra chiến sự và đối đầu với Việt Nam."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-df404f664a0d60546a9e31eb5bdff3ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3e2d86a8a15344ff5c25829117f928c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc55d62fe8c98a4db1992322d16a5280&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e1e11930ab01fb061749acffe85b755&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48e0ff15a988913e85c0426ea19d7198&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43ffd57cec3dd07166a619a76148c755&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4820a393047d71ddfc9dd25445f040a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3692b44304ff5da1927dfcb9ab90461&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4549a0a33a97f39084dfcd2d857e18f8</data>
      <data key="d3">1887&lt;SEP&gt;1978&lt;SEP&gt;1979&lt;SEP&gt;1989&lt;SEP&gt;\"1979\"</data>
      <data key="d4">CAMBODIA&lt;SEP&gt;CAMPUCHIA&lt;SEP&gt;SHAPING REGIONAL SECURITY DYNAMICS.\"&lt;SEP&gt;VƯƠNG QUỐC CAMPUCHIA&lt;SEP&gt;\"CAMPUCHIA (CAMBODIA) IS THE COUNTRY WHERE VIETNAM CONDUCTED A FOREIGN-MILITARY PRESENCE FROM 1979 TO 1989 AND LATER WITHDREW ITS TROOPS IN 1989</data>
