    <node id="&quot;ĐỔI MỚI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">""&lt;SEP&gt;"A major set of economic reforms and opening measures in Vietnam, marking a shift toward a market-oriented economy."&lt;SEP&gt;"Economic reforms in Vietnam beginning in the late 1980s, marking a major shift in policy."&lt;SEP&gt;"1986"&lt;SEP&gt;"Comprehensive economic and political modernization program in Việt Nam, initiated as a reform strategy following the Sixth Party Congress."&lt;SEP&gt;"Economic reforms initiated in the late 1980s in Vietnam."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vietnam's economic reform program initiated at the end of 1986, signaling a shift to market-oriented policies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Đổi Mới reforms (Renovation) initiated in Vietnam in 1986 to reform the economy and political system."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vietnam's economic renovation program introducing market-oriented reforms; foundational for modernization."&lt;SEP&gt;"Đổi Mới (Renovation) was officially launched in 1986 by General Secretary Nguyễn Văn Linh as a broad reform program to transform Vietnam's economy and society."&lt;SEP&gt;"Đổi Mới là chính sách cải cách kinh tế ở cuối thập kỷ 1980, hướng tới mở cửa và cải cách kinh tế Việt Nam."</data>
