    <node id="&quot;NHÀ NGÔ&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dynasty founded by Ngô Quyền; part of early mediaeval Vietnamese history."&lt;SEP&gt;"First native ruling dynasty after independence; established in 939; part of the early Vietnamese dynastic sequence including Ngô, Đinh, Tiền Lê, Lý, Trần, Hồ, Hậu Lê, Mạc, Lê Trung hưng, Tây Sơn, and Nguyễn."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ngô Dynasty, established as the first native dynasty after independence and beginning a native imperial line."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ngô dynasty, a Vietnamese royal house established by Ngô Quyền that consolidated power and laid groundwork for independence in the 10th century."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vietnamese dynasty that restored independence in 939."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ngô dynasty; the early Vietnamese dynastic period established by Ngô Quyền."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nhà Ngô được thành lập để khôi phục độc lập dân tộc ở Việt Nam vào năm 939."</data>
