    <node id="&quot;QUỐC GIA VIỆT NAM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">""&lt;SEP&gt;"Nước Việt Nam được công nhận nền tự trị và hình thành, với thủ đô tại Sài Gòn."&lt;SEP&gt;"State in southern Vietnam that was renamed to Vietnam Cộng hòa after Ngô Đình Diệm's leadership; prior to the rename it governed the southern region under a French-influenced framework."&lt;SEP&gt;"State of Vietnam; government established by France in 1949 within the French Union to counterbalance the Việt Nam Dân chủ Cộng hòa."&lt;SEP&gt;"State of Vietnam; its government formally withdrew from the French Union in December 1955."&lt;SEP&gt;"State of Vietnam established in 1949; capital in Saigon; sovereign status within the French Union."&lt;SEP&gt;"The State of Vietnam established in 1949 after negotiations with France; capital in Saigon; sovereign status within the French Union."&lt;SEP&gt;"1949"&lt;|"State of Vietnam established in 1949, with Bao Dai as head of state; formed from negotiations with France and nationalists."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chính phủ Quốc gia Việt Nam thuộc Khối Liên hiệp Pháp trong năm 1949."&lt;SEP&gt;"State of Vietnam; withdrew from the French Union in December 1955."</data>
