    <node id="&quot;KHỐI LIÊN HIỆP PHÁP&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">""&lt;SEP&gt;"French Union bloc; governing framework in Indochina; associated with 1949 government.""&lt;SEP&gt;"French Union; colonial bloc that oversaw Indochina and Vietnam, mentioned in connection with 1887."&lt;SEP&gt;"Khối liên hiệp Pháp; nền tảng cho tự trị và sự quản lý thuộc địa tại Đông Dương."&lt;SEP&gt;"The French Union, the political entity that governed French Indochina post-war arrangements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The French Union; the bloc of France and its colonies in Indochina; referenced as the organization from which Vietnam withdrew in December 1955."&lt;SEP&gt;"The French Union; the political bloc allied with France."&lt;SEP&gt;"The French Union bloc through which France claimed to grant nominal autonomy to Vietnam while preserving influence."&lt;SEP&gt;"The French Union, an organizational framework established in 1946."&lt;SEP&gt;""&lt;|"The French Union bloc consisting of France and its colonies and protectorates."&lt;SEP&gt;"French Union; political alliance of France and its territories, from which Vietnam's government withdrew in December 1955."&lt;SEP&gt;"Khối Liên hiệp Pháp là liên minh chính trị của Pháp tại thời kỳ đế quốc thuộc địa."&lt;SEP&gt;"The French Union framework within which France recognized Vietnamese autonomy, as described in the 1946 negotiations."</data>
