    <node id="&quot;LIÊN XÔ&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">""&lt;SEP&gt;"Cung cấp viện trợ vũ khí, trang thiết bị quân sự và hậu cần cho Việt Nam Dân chủ Cộng hòa."&lt;SEP&gt;"Liên Xô (Liên bang Xô-viết); hỗ trợ quân sự cho Việt Nam và ký kết hiệp ước liên minh năm 1978."&lt;SEP&gt;"Liên Xô (Soviet Union) was a major ally providing substantial economic and military aid to Vietnam in the 1980s and influenced trade through Comecon."&lt;SEP&gt;"Phía VNDCCH nhận được sự hỗ trợ to lớn từ Liên Xô."&lt;SEP&gt;"Soviet Union; provided aid to North Vietnam during the Vietnam War era."&lt;SEP&gt;"Soviet Union; recognized the Việt Minh government in 1950 and supported communist movements in Vietnam."&lt;SEP&gt;"Soviet Union, major ally of the DRV during the Cold War."&lt;SEP&gt;"Soviet Union; provided support to VNDCCH."&lt;SEP&gt;"Soviet Union; recognized Việt Minh and backed its military efforts."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Soviet Union, ally of Vietnam."&lt;SEP&gt;"USSR; major supplier of economic and military aid to Việt Nam during the 1980s, with most exports and imports tied to the Soviet market and Comecon member states."&lt;SEP&gt;"Soviet Union; provided aid to Việt Nam Dân chủ Cộng hòa."&lt;SEP&gt;"Soviet Union; provided significant economic and military aid; signed a mutual defense treaty in 1978."&lt;SEP&gt;"Soviet Union; provided substantial support to VNDCCH along with China."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Soviet Union; it recognized the Viet Minh government in early 1950 and provided military aid to Vietnam."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Soviet Union; supplied aid to Vietnam around 1950."&lt;SEP&gt;""&lt;|"The Soviet Union; provided military and material aid to the Viet Minh during the Indochina War."&lt;SEP&gt;"Liên Xô là nước lớn viện trợ cho Việt Nam Dân chủ Cộng hòa trong cuộc chiến tranh Đông Dương."&lt;SEP&gt;"Liên bang Xô viết; đồng minh của Việt Nam; ký kết hiệp ước với Việt Nam năm 1978."&lt;SEP&gt;"Soviet Union; allied with VNDCCH."&lt;SEP&gt;"Soviet Union; recognized the Viet Minh government in 1950."&lt;SEP&gt;"Soviet Union; referenced as the place where Nguyễn Ái Quốc worked with the Comintern."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Soviet Union; provided substantial economic and military aid to Vietnam in the 1980s and shaped its trade through Comecon markets."&lt;SEP&gt;"Soviet Union; mentioned alongside other Western Allies in the context of post-war political ceremonies."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-0e1e11930ab01fb061749acffe85b755&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4549a0a33a97f39084dfcd2d857e18f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dae09351baefd2c96da656733c534ccd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ebc4b0a454e2ea3adc019759de704c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43ffd57cec3dd07166a619a76148c755&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b60881720494b2801d1866f2d58b8eb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c715893072e90e3f1536ec249629f939&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4820a393047d71ddfc9dd25445f040a</data>
      <data key="d3">1945&lt;SEP&gt;1950&lt;SEP&gt;1950"&lt;SEP&gt;1978&lt;SEP&gt;1980</data>
      <data key="d4">LIÊN XÔ&lt;SEP&gt;SOVIET UNION&lt;SEP&gt;USSR</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TRUNG QUỐC&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">""&lt;SEP&gt;"China is the regional power that attacked Việt Nam in early 1979, a primary antagonist in the Vietnam–China disputes over the South China Sea, and a participant in the Chengdu talks that led to normalization with Việt Nam in 1990–1991."&lt;SEP&gt;"China; involved in territorial disputes with Vietnam in the South China Sea."&lt;SEP&gt;"China; major historical influence in the region."&lt;SEP&gt;"China; major regional power; involved in disputes with Vietnam in the South China Sea."&lt;SEP&gt;"China; the text notes revolutions in China as a source of inspiration for Vietnamese reformers.""&lt;SEP&gt;"Cung cấp viện trợ vũ khí, trang thiết bị quân sự và hậu cần cho Việt Nam Dân chủ Cộng hòa."&lt;SEP&gt;"Neighboring country to the north; involved in the 1979 border conflict and later diplomatic normalization with Vietnam."&lt;SEP&gt;"People's Republic of China; provided substantial aid to the Việt Minh and VNDCCH during the 1950s."&lt;SEP&gt;"Phía VNDCCH nhận được sự hỗ trợ to lớn từ Trung Quốc."&lt;SEP&gt;"Trung Quốc is a neighboring power that opposed Vietnam's alliance with the Soviet Union and was a central player in bilateral tensions and regional disputes with Vietnam, including its stance on Vietnam–China relations and the South China Sea context."&lt;SEP&gt;"Trung Quốc xua quân tấn công vào các tỉnh biên giới phía Bắc Việt Nam đầu năm 1979."&lt;SEP&gt;"China; major source of support for VNDCCH and its allies."&lt;SEP&gt;"People's Republic of China, ally of the DRV during the Cold War and involved in border conflicts."&lt;SEP&gt;"Provided military aid to Việt Minh / Việt Nam Dân chủ Cộng hòa; supported the North."&lt;SEP&gt;"Southern China; origin region of migrations into Southeast Asia discussed in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"Trung Quốc (China), referenced as a source of revolutionary waves and a regional context for Vietnamese activists."&lt;SEP&gt;"Trung Quốc, a neighboring country to the north of Vietnam, referenced as the opponent in the 1979 border conflict."&lt;SEP&gt;"Trung Quốc, country mentioned in relation to conflicts and regional tensions."&lt;SEP&gt;"China, Vietnam's neighbor; involved in territorial disputes with Vietnam in the South China Sea."&lt;SEP&gt;"China, Vietnam's northern neighbor; involved in border conflicts and regional diplomacy."&lt;SEP&gt;"China, a major regional power, is described as opposing Vietnam's close alliance with the Soviet Union and as a key player in regional diplomatic tensions."&lt;SEP&gt;"China; provided substantial support to VNDCCH along with the Soviet Union."&lt;SEP&gt;"China; used in the text to describe the broader geographic area (northern China) involved in the historical narratives."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nước Trung Quốc; lực lượng đảng cộng sản dưới Mao Trạch Đông đã lập nên một nhà nước mới vào tháng 10 năm 1949; cung cấp viện trợ quân sự cho Việt Minh."&lt;SEP&gt;"People's Republic of China; provided aid to DRV and engaged in regional conflicts."&lt;SEP&gt;"People’s Republic of China; attacked northern Vietnam in early 1979 in retaliation for earlier conflict."&lt;SEP&gt;"Quốc gia có làn sóng cách mạng được nhắc đến cùng với Nga."&lt;SEP&gt;"The People's Republic of China; provided military and material support to Vietnam around 1950."&lt;SEP&gt;""&lt;|"China; provided significant military and material aid to Vietnam during the Indochina War."&lt;SEP&gt;"A country in East Asia; cited as the origin region of early rice farming communities that migrated to Southeast Asia."&lt;SEP&gt;"China; provided support to the VNDCCH framework."&lt;SEP&gt;"China; referenced as inspiration and setting for revolutionary movements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Neighboring country in East Asia; fought Vietnam in 1979 and later established diplomatic relations with Vietnam in 1991."&lt;SEP&gt;"People's Republic of China; country involved in supporting Viet Minh."&lt;SEP&gt;"Quốc gia ở Đông Á; liên quan đến các vụ tấn công biên giới Việt Nam năm 1979."&lt;SEP&gt;"Trung Quốc is a major East Asian power that opposed Vietnam's alignment with the Soviet Union, launched a border invasion in 1979, and later participated in regional diplomacy culminating in normalization with Vietnam following the 1990 Thành Đô summit."&lt;SEP&gt;"Trung Quốc is a neighboring country with disputes in the South China Sea."&lt;SEP&gt;"Trung Quốc là nước viện trợ cho Việt Nam Dân chủ Cộng hòa trong thời kỳ chiến tranh."&lt;SEP&gt;"China, the country of Tưởng Giới Thạch mentioned in parentheses."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-0e1e11930ab01fb061749acffe85b755&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc55d62fe8c98a4db1992322d16a5280&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18d8e97a0e4680cead04b467abbaf21b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8643f67e9d45af93e4e82b2745d1580&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4549a0a33a97f39084dfcd2d857e18f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48e0ff15a988913e85c0426ea19d7198&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df404f664a0d60546a9e31eb5bdff3ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ebc4b0a454e2ea3adc019759de704c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43ffd57cec3dd07166a619a76148c755&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b60881720494b2801d1866f2d58b8eb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c715893072e90e3f1536ec249629f939&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4820a393047d71ddfc9dd25445f040a</data>
      <data key="d3">1949&lt;SEP&gt;1949"&lt;SEP&gt;1950&lt;SEP&gt;1950"&lt;SEP&gt;1979</data>
      <data key="d4">CHINA&lt;SEP&gt;PEOPLE'S REPUBLIC OF CHINA&lt;SEP&gt;TRUNG QUỐC</data>
