      <data key="d1">"A ruling dynasty/faction in Vietnam that faced upheaval during the Nguyễn–Trịnh wars."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dynastic faction opposing Nguyễn Ánh; weakened internally after Quang Trung's death; faced Nguyễn campaigns."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dynastic faction ruling the Tây Sơn region; allied against Nguyễn Ánh during the conflict."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dynasty of Vietnam in the late 18th century; part of the broader dynastic history."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Tây Sơn uprising in 18th-century Vietnam attracted peasants, artisans, Catholics, ethnic minorities, and Hoa merchants, ultimately challenging the Nguyễn regime and reshaping regional power."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tây Sơn dynasty, a Vietnamese ruling house."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dynasty/faction that ruled parts of Vietnam and opposed Nguyễn Ánh."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tây Sơn dynasty."&lt;SEP&gt;"Triều đại Tây Sơn nổi lên tại Việt Nam và đóng vai trò then chốt trong thời kỳ khởi nghĩa cuối thế kỷ 18."</data>
