    <node id="&quot;LẠC VIỆT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">""&lt;SEP&gt;"Cộng đồng cư dân cổ ở miền Bắc Việt Nam, liên quan đến nền Đông Sơn."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lạc Việt refers to the indigenous people of the Red River Delta who formed the base for traditional crafts and early state formation within the Đông Sơn context."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dân tộc cổ Việt Nam, một thành phần của Bách Việt."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lạc Việt is the indigenous population in the Đồng bằng sông Hồng region; their presence contributed to the Đông Sơn cultural development."&lt;SEP&gt;"Indigenous Vietnamese people noted for advanced copper-bronze metallurgy and rice agriculture."&gt;</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2c272541ed6794431c00e6ca7ce7f4da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8643f67e9d45af93e4e82b2745d1580</data>
      <data key="d3" />
      <data key="d4">LAC VIET&lt;SEP&gt;LẠC VIỆT</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;VĂN HÓA ĐÔNG SƠN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A Bronze Age culture of the Vietnamese people, associated with advanced bronze metallurgy and artifacts; originated in and linked to northern Vietnam, with ties to the Đông Sơn culture across northern Vietnam, Guangxi (Quảng Tây), and Laos; connected with ancient states Văn Lang, Âu Lạc, and Hồng Bàng."&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;"Bronze Age culture in northern Vietnam."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bronze Age culture located in northern Vietnam (1,000 BCE – 100 CE), named after the Đông Sơn region."&lt;SEP&gt;"Văn hóa Đông Sơn (1.000 TCN – 100 SCN); nền văn hóa nổi bật ở miền Bắc Việt Nam, gắn với Văn Lang, Âu Lạc và Hồng Bàng."&lt;SEP&gt;"Văn hóa Đông Sơn (1.000 TCN – 100 SCN), nguồn gốc từ miền Bắc Việt Nam và là nền tảng cho các nhà nước Văn Lang, Âu Lạc và Hồng Bàng."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nền Văn hóa Đông Sơn ra đời ở thiên niên kỉ thứ 1 TCN, dựa trên thâm canh lúa nước và tập trung quanh các bộ tộc bản địa."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2c272541ed6794431c00e6ca7ce7f4da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43ffd57cec3dd07166a619a76148c755</data>
      <data key="d3">1000"</data>
      <data key="d4">VĂN HÓA ĐÔNG SƠN</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ĐÔNG SƠN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Region associated with the Đông Sơn culture and its artifacts, including drums."&lt;SEP&gt;"Đông Sơn is a northern Vietnamese region associated with the Đông Sơn culture, renowned for advanced bronze metallurgy, tool and weapon making, and exquisitely crafted bronze drums. The artifacts carry strong symbolic value and were primarily used in spiritual or community ceremonies. Creating these works required skilled metalworkers, proficiency in lost-wax casting, and mastery of composition and engraving of intricate patterns."&lt;SEP&gt;"Đông Sơn culture, an ancient Vietnamese culture centered around the Red River Delta region."&lt;SEP&gt;"Đông Sơn is a Bronze Age site in northern Vietnam associated with the Đông Sơn culture; it is notable for advanced metallurgy (copper-tin bronze), skilled tool and weapon production, and exquisite drums used in spiritual rituals and communal ceremonies. The text notes mastery of techniques such as lost-wax casting and meticulous engraving of decorative patterns."&lt;SEP&gt;"Đông Sơn is a site in northern Vietnam associated with the Đông Sơn culture; known for high-quality bronze-casting metallurgy, mastery of tool and weapon fabrication, and exquisite bronze drums; artifacts carry deep symbolic value and are used mainly in spiritual or communal rituals; artisans require advanced smelting and lost-wax casting techniques, and excel in layout and engraving of intricate patterns."&lt;SEP&gt;"Region associated with the Đông Sơn culture and its artifacts."&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;"Đông Sơn is the place associated with the 500 BCE reference in the text, marking the origin of the Đông Sơn culture and the site where high-quality bronze metallurgy and sacred artifacts were developed by local communities."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2c272541ed6794431c00e6ca7ce7f4da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8643f67e9d45af93e4e82b2745d1580&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43ffd57cec3dd07166a619a76148c755</data>
      <data key="d3">0500&lt;SEP&gt;500</data>
      <data key="d4">DONG SON&lt;SEP&gt;VĂN HÓA ĐÔNG SƠN&lt;SEP&gt;ĐÔNG SƠN</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;QUẢNG TÂY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A region in present-day southwestern China mentioned as part of Han-era territorial references related to Nam Việt."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chinese province (Guangxi); part of the broader northern Vietnam region's historical connections."&lt;SEP&gt;"Region in southern China; mentioned in geographic context."&lt;SEP&gt;"Region in southern China; referenced as a location related to the 1075 campaign."&lt;SEP&gt;"Region mentioned as part of territorial description (land now in modern Guangxi) during this period."&lt;SEP&gt;"Khu vực Đông Nam Trung Quốc (nơi nguồn gốc Đông Sơn được cho là bắt nguồn từ)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Quảng Tây is a region in southern China mentioned as the origin area for Triệu Đà."&lt;SEP&gt;"Quảng Tây is the Chinese regional area where the Tống bases Ung Châu, Khâm Châu, and Liêm Châu lie."&lt;SEP&gt;"Historical region in southern China; mentioned as part of the geographic area connected to Nam Việt and Triệu Đà."&lt;SEP&gt;"Khu vực phía Bắc Trung Quốc, được nêu là nguồn gốc của một phần nền Văn hóa Đông Sơn."&lt;SEP&gt;"Quảng Tây"&lt;SEP&gt;"Region where Song bases were located during the 1075 campaign."&lt;SEP&gt;"Frontier region on the border with Đại Việt; referenced as part of the Song invasion context in 1075."&lt;SEP&gt;"Geographic area mentioned as part of the land affected by Han administration near Nam Việt."&lt;SEP&gt;"Quảng Tây is the southern Chinese region linked to the Nam Việt era."&lt;SEP&gt;"Region cited as a source region for the Đông Sơn culture (Guangxi)."&gt;</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2c272541ed6794431c00e6ca7ce7f4da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8643f67e9d45af93e4e82b2745d1580&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01995274690fe1835d7836e3a481a678&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-277e0e3e66eb14031c1d448dfa63e42c</data>
      <data key="d3">0040&lt;SEP&gt;1075</data>
      <data key="d4">GUANGXI&lt;SEP&gt;QUẢNG TÂY</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LÀO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Chiến tranh cũng lan rộng sang Lào."&lt;SEP&gt;"Laos; later incorporated into the Indochina Federation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Neighboring country to Vietnam in the northwest; part of the wider regional history."&lt;SEP&gt;"Khu vực Đông Nam Á có liên quan tới sự khởi lên của các nền văn hóa cổ Việt Nam."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lao region; included in Indochina federation.""&lt;SEP&gt;"Laos; Southeast Asian country; war spillover into this neighboring nation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Laos; integrated into the Indochina Federation by 1893."&lt;SEP&gt;"Laos; region affected by the war’s spillover."&lt;SEP&gt;"Quốc gia Đông Nam Á được nhắc đến như một phần khu vực Đông Nam Á."&lt;SEP&gt;"Laos incorporated into Indochina in 1893."&lt;SEP&gt;"Laos; the war spillover affected this country."&lt;SEP&gt;"Region cited as a source region for the Đông Sơn culture."&gt;</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2c272541ed6794431c00e6ca7ce7f4da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3e2d86a8a15344ff5c25829117f928c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4549a0a33a97f39084dfcd2d857e18f8</data>
      <data key="d3">1893</data>
      <data key="d4">LAOS&lt;SEP&gt;LÀO</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BIỂN ĐÔNG&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Biển phía đông Việt Nam, nơi giao lưu và tác động của các nền văn hóa cổ."&lt;SEP&gt;"Biển Đông (the South China Sea) is a site of territorial disputes referenced in the broader Vietnam–China tensions."&lt;SEP&gt;"East Sea, the body of water along Vietnam’s coastline."&lt;SEP&gt;"South China Sea; disputed maritime area involving Vietnam and China."&lt;SEP&gt;"The South China Sea; referenced in context of territorial disputes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Biển Đông, a maritime region near Vietnam involved in territorial disputes."&lt;SEP&gt;"South China Sea, the arena of disputes, notably with China."&lt;SEP&gt;"South China Sea, where Việt Nam and China have territorial disputes."&lt;SEP&gt;"South China Sea; site of territorial disputes involving Việt Nam and China."&lt;SEP&gt;"South China Sea, the site of Vietnam's territorial disputes."&lt;SEP&gt;"South China Sea; site of territorial disputes referenced in relation to Vietnam's border tensions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vùng biển nơi tuyến Con đường ngọc bích trên biển hoạt động; là khu vực quan trọng của giao thương cổ đại."&lt;SEP&gt;"Biển Đông (South China Sea) is the site of territorial disputes involving Trung Quốc."&lt;SEP&gt;"South China Sea; site of territorial disputes involving Vietnam and China."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-b4820a393047d71ddfc9dd25445f040a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e1e11930ab01fb061749acffe85b755&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c272541ed6794431c00e6ca7ce7f4da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48e0ff15a988913e85c0426ea19d7198</data>
