    <node id="&quot;AN DƯƠNG VƯƠNG&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An Dương Vương (also known as Thục Phán) was the ruler associated with the founding of the Âu Lạc kingdom; his era marks the formation and leadership of Âu Lạc."&lt;SEP&gt;"Legendary ruler of Âu Lạc; also known as Thục Phán; associated with the Nỏ thần in legends; moved the capital to Phong Khê."&lt;SEP&gt;"Thục Phán, who proclaimed himself An Dương Vương; associated with the defense of Văn Lang, founding the state of Âu Lạc, and moving the capital to Phong Khê."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Dương Vương is the ruler who, under the name Thục Phán, unified or established the kingdom of Âu Lạc and later moved the capital to Phong Khê."</data>
