      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The period of Chinese domination in Vietnam is described (111 BCE–938 CE), starting with the Bắc thuộc era."&lt;SEP&gt;"The period of Chinese domination in Vietnam, spanning 111 BCE to 938 CE."&lt;SEP&gt;"The period of Chinese domination in northern Vietnam, spanning from 111 BCE to 938 CE."&lt;SEP&gt;"Thời kỳ Bắc thuộc (Northern Domination) outlines Vietnamese history from 111 BCE to 938 CE, with a noted first phase 111 BCE–40 CE."</data>
