      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"First period of Chinese rule (Bắc thuộc lần thứ nhất) in Vietnam."&lt;SEP&gt;"First period of Han domination over Vietnam (111 BCE–40 CE) with the establishment of Giao Chỉ, Cửu Chân, and Nhật Nam."&lt;SEP&gt;"First phase of Chinese rule in northern Vietnam from 111 BCE to 40 CE."&lt;SEP&gt;"The first phase of Northern Domination, dated 111 BCE to 40 CE."&lt;SEP&gt;"The first stage of Bắc thuộc, 111 BCE to 40 CE."&lt;SEP&gt;"The first phase of Chinese domination of Vietnam is noted as 111 BCE–40 CE."</data>
