      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Capital city to which An Dương Vương reportedly moved."&lt;SEP&gt;"Phong Khê is the place to which An Dương Vương reportedly moved his capital."&lt;SEP&gt;"Phong Khê is the city to which An Dương Vương moved his capital."&lt;SEP&gt;"Phong Khê is the city to which An Dương Vương moved the capital."</data>
