    <node id="&quot;CAO BẰNG&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A province in northeastern Vietnam where Phai Khắt and Nà Ngần are located."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cao Bằng Province is cited as the region associated with the capital's locality in northern Vietnam."&lt;SEP&gt;"Northern Vietnamese province mentioned as part of the homeland region."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vùng núi hiểm trở nơi căn cứ cuối cùng của Nhà Mạc bị diệt bỏ sau năm 1592, và sau đó tiếp tục bị Trịnh Tạc quét sạch vào 1677."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cao Bằng is a northern Vietnamese area mentioned as the modern location of the Nam Việt capital’s base."&lt;SEP&gt;"Northern province where the remnants of the Mạc dynasty held out until 1677."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tỉnh Cao Bằng; province containing Phai Khăt."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tỉnh Cao Bằng; province containing Phai Khắt."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cao Bằng is the region near which the historic capital region is described as located."&lt;SEP&gt;"Northern province where remnants of the Mạc dynasty persisted until 1677."&lt;SEP&gt;"Province attacked by Việt Minh units during uprisings."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-dab4a6d06213a3107d9e1ca29469f707&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3bfa206adeee22a1ede2ef2ae0ad9711&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8643f67e9d45af93e4e82b2745d1580&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7418e6f1b899c505272caee02f3cf1ff</data>
      <data key="d3">1944</data>
      <data key="d4">CAO BANG&lt;SEP&gt;CAO BANG PROVINCE&lt;SEP&gt;CAO BẰNG</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;QUẢNG ĐÔNG&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Chinese province; part of the areas targeted in Song–Đại Việt military activity."&lt;SEP&gt;"Historical region in southern China; cited as part of the northern frontier region related to Triệu Đà and the Nam Việt context."&lt;SEP&gt;"Quảng Đông is the adjacent Chinese region mentioned in relation to these bases."&lt;SEP&gt;"Quảng Đông is the historic region in southern China mentioned as the origin area for Triệu Đà."&lt;SEP&gt;"Region in China; referenced in the context of the 1075 campaign."&lt;SEP&gt;"Region in southern China; described as the origin area for Triệu Đà."&lt;SEP&gt;"Region where Song bases were located during the 1075 campaign."&lt;SEP&gt;"Quảng Đông is the southern Chinese region linked to the Nam Việt era."</data>
