      <data key="d1">""&lt;SEP&gt;""&lt;SEP&gt;"Chengdu, a major city connected to the route used for goods from An Nam."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chengdu, the site of a secret Vietnam–China summit in September 1990 that paved the way for bilateral normalization in 1991."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chengdu; a node on the inland route network referenced."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chengdu; site of a secret Vietnam–China summit in September 1990 that paved the way for bilateral normalization in 1991.&lt;SEP&gt;"Chengdu, site of the secret Vietnam–China talks in September 1990."&lt;SEP&gt;"Thành Đô was the site of a secret high-level summit between Vietnam and China in 1990, leading to the formal normalization of their bilateral relations (1991)."</data>
