    <node id="&quot;NAM CHIẾU&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">""&lt;SEP&gt;""Nam Chiếu was a rival southern polity whose forces fought against Đại Việt in the period described."&lt;SEP&gt;"A kingdom from Vân Nam that intervened in the region, incited rebellion, and siege of Tống Bình."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vương quốc ở Vân Nam can thiệp vào khu vực An Nam, bao vây Tống Bình và liên minh với các lực lượng bản địa."&lt;SEP&gt;"A powerful king­dom in Yunnan that intervened in An Nam, besieged Tống Bình, and allied with local tribes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Kingdom in Yunnan that intervened in An Nam and besieged Tống Bình."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nam Chiếu was a historical kingdom/force opposing local Vietnamese powers."&lt;&gt;"&lt;SEP&gt;"Nam Chiếu Army; a rival southern polity mentioned in the text that conducted incursions into the Tĩnh Hải quân and was repelled by local forces."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vương quốc Nam Chiếu ở Vân Nam can thiệp vào An Nam."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nam Chiếu is a historical kingdom/army that invaded or contested Đại Việt; depicted as the opposing force repelled by Vietnamese rulers in the narrative."</data>
