    <node id="&quot;TĨNH HẢI QUÂN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A semi-autonomous political-military region in early Đại Việt history; from 905 under local Vietnamese lords and later becoming effectively independent."&lt;SEP&gt;"Old name of the Vietnamese state before the 968 renaming to Đại Cồ Việt."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tên gọi sau khi An Nam đổi tên; vùng quản lý quân sự dưới Đường."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tĩnh Hải quân is the historical name of the Vietnamese frontier/state before the renaming to Đại Cồ Việt, referenced as the early state in this narrative."&lt;SEP&gt;"Old name for Đại Cồ Việt before the renaming in 968."&lt;SEP&gt;"Regional military prefecture in northern Vietnam, autonomous under local Vietnamese leaders; later becomes effectively independent and engages in tributary relations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tên hiệu của khu vực sau khi đổi tên An Nam; quản lý khu vực Bắc Việt."&lt;SEP&gt;"Historic Vietnamese military-administrative region that later operated with autonomous local rule; initially renamed from An Nam in 866."</data>
