    <node id="&quot;ĐẠI VIỆT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">""&lt;SEP&gt;""&lt;SEP&gt;""Đại Việt is the Vietnamese kingdom/dynasty referenced as the historic state that maintains sovereignty and evolves through the period."&lt;SEP&gt;"A major Vietnamese kingdom/empire that interacted with Cham Pa; in 1312 Cham Pa became its vassal; later suffered decline in the 14th century."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"Historic Vietnamese kingdom that fought Ming occupation and later became the basis for the Vietnamese state in this period."&lt;SEP&gt;"Historical Vietnamese kingdom; during Tây Sơn rule its territory was effectively partitioned into two distinct political entities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Medieval Vietnamese kingdom; resisted Mongol invasions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Vietnamese realm across which the Mạc–Lê–Trịnh–Nguyễn conflicts unfolded."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Vietnamese state characterized by independence and its institutions during Ly rule."&lt;SEP&gt;"Đại Việt is the historic Vietnamese state name used after renaming from Đại Cồ Việt; it appears in the broader historical timeline described in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"A medieval Vietnamese realm that was the suzerain power over Champa in 1312 and underwent major upheavals in the 14th century, eventually renamed Đại Ngu under Hồ Quý Ly."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Vietnamese kingdom in which the events occur, continuing after the Lý dynasty and engaging in battles with the Mongol Empire."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Vietnamese kingdom name used after renaming; later utilized during the Lý and Trần periods."&lt;SEP&gt;"The country restored to sovereignty under Lê Lợi, taking the name Đại Việt."&lt;SEP&gt;"The emergent Vietnamese state following Tĩnh Hải quân's de facto independence."&lt;SEP&gt;"Đại Việt is the name of the Vietnamese state after Lý Thánh Tông's reforms and later became the broader historical term for the nation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Historical Vietnamese nation referred to in the text as the country under various rulers."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Vietnamese kingdom established by the Ly dynasty, later known as Đại Việt; historically also referred to as Đại Cồ Việt."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Vietnamese kingdom that declines after Lê Thánh Tông's death (period 1497–1527), with six kings ruling over about 30 years."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vietnamese state restored under Lê Lợi; later associated with Lê dynasty."&lt;SEP&gt;"Đại Việt is the Vietnamese kingdom involved in the Champa conflict, experienced periods of decline during the Trần era, and later faced dynastic upheavals and Ming domination that led to major state changes."&lt;SEP&gt;"A historic Vietnamese kingdom that subordinated Cham Pa as a vassal in 1312 and faced Cham-led wars in the 14th century."&lt;SEP&gt;"A historical Vietnamese kingdom that declined after the death of Lê Thánh Tông during 1497–1527."&lt;SEP&gt;"Historical Vietnamese kingdom restored under Lê Lợi; later renamed/relocated capital to Đông Kinh."&lt;SEP&gt;"Historical name for the Vietnamese state used during the feudal era; referenced as the realm that central authorities governed."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Vietnamese kingdom that resisted Mongol invasions and engaged in diplomatic relations, later expanding influence."&lt;SEP&gt;"The broader Vietnamese realm referenced in the context of Tây Sơn and Nguyễn conflicts."&lt;SEP&gt;"The historic Vietnamese state under which the Lý dynasty built infrastructure, administered taxes, and governed; later the country name used after Lý Thánh Tông's reforms."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Vietnamese nationalist faction mentioned in the context of regional control."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-18d8e97a0e4680cead04b467abbaf21b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27e11721fea6555c621a81136e468f9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-277e0e3e66eb14031c1d448dfa63e42c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6033ac15f370150074084b2248ba04f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ca8856a3c05c7e29106b40dae03794b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1095d21a9a487ebf90afcd96d02737d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4943e96cb569799b168fc03f9b7f0d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dab4a6d06213a3107d9e1ca29469f707&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-561d10717f3ff788e1032021a4cf0614</data>
      <data key="d3">1010&lt;SEP&gt;1312&lt;SEP&gt;1497–1527&lt;SEP&gt;939</data>
      <data key="d4">""'&lt;SEP&gt;DAI VIET&lt;SEP&gt;VIỆT NAM&lt;SEP&gt;ĐẠI CỒ VIỆT&lt;SEP&gt;ĐẠI VIỆT&lt;SEP&gt;ĐẠI VIỆT QUỐC</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SÔNG BẠCH ĐẰNG&quot;">
