      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A former Vietnamese warlord used as a figurehead by Champa in attacks on Đại Cồ Việt."&lt;SEP&gt;"A former Vietnamese warlord who sought refuge in Champa; Cham Pa used him as a figurehead to attack Đại Cồ Việt."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ngô Nhật Khánh, a Vietnamese former local lord who sought Cham Pa aid during Loạn 12 sứ quân but perished."&lt;SEP&gt;"A former Vietnamese warlord who sought Cham support; connected with Champa's attack on Đại Cồ Việt.&lt;SEP&gt;"Ngô Nhật Khánh, a former Vietnamese marcher, sought Cham protection; Champa’s king supported him, but the efforts faltered and their envoy was captured."</data>
