    <node id="&quot;LÊ HOÀN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A capable military leader who lured the Song forces into Chi Lăng, killed the enemy commander Hầu Nhân Bảo, and later became emperor (Lê Đại Hành)."&lt;SEP&gt;"A capable military leader who lured the Song invaders into Chi Lăng and killed Hầu Nhân Bảo; later known as Lê Đại Hành."&lt;SEP&gt;"A ruler whose death is mentioned as a turning point before Lý Công Uẩn's rise to power."&lt;SEP&gt;"Thập Đạo Tướng quân Lê Hoàn, who later founded the Tiền Lê dynasty and defeated the Song invaders; orchestrated the Chi Lăng ambush."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lê Hoàn, the previous king, died and created a power vacuum; Lý Công Uẩn had opportunities to seize power but did not."&lt;SEP&gt;"A military leader who later becomes emperor Lê Đại Hành, and who engineered the Chi Lăng ambush against Song forces in 981."&lt;SEP&gt;"A ruler mentioned in context as having died before Lý Uẩn's rise."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lê Hoàn was a king whose death created a power vacuum after which Lý Công Uẩn rose; the text notes he had opportunities to seize power but did not."&lt;SEP&gt;"Thập Đạo Tướng quân Lê Hoàn repelled the Song invasion by luring the forces into ải Chi Lăng, then was crowned and became Lê Đại Hành Hoàng đế, founder of the Tiền Lê."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-27e11721fea6555c621a81136e468f9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-277e0e3e66eb14031c1d448dfa63e42c</data>
