    <node id="&quot;LÊ LONG ĐĨNH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A king of the Lê dynasty who is noted to have died in 1009 in the opening sentence."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lê Long Đĩnh, revered as a controversial ruler who died at 24 after violent governance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Last of Đinh-era princes; his death precipitated bloody succession."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lê Long Đĩnh was a Vietnamese king whose death occurred in 1009, and his passing paved the way for Lý Công Uẩn to be proclaimed emperor and to found the Lý dynasty."&lt;SEP&gt;"Final king to emerge from the bloody succession after 1005, a notorious ruler in Vietnamese history."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lê Long Đĩnh was a Vietnamese king who died in 1009, and his death paved the way for the rise of Lý Công Uẩn and the establishment of the Ly dynasty."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-27e11721fea6555c621a81136e468f9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-277e0e3e66eb14031c1d448dfa63e42c</data>
