      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dynasty founded by Lý Công Uẩn in 1010 that governed Đại Việt through much of the medieval period."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nhà Lý, the dynasty founded by Lý Công Uẩn."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lý dynasty, a ruling Vietnamese royal house during the 10th–12th centuries, whose decline and replacement by the Trần dynasty is described in the text."</data>
