      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">""&lt;SEP&gt;"A Vietnamese royal dynasty that ruled Đại Việt and presided over a period of decline in the 14th century amid internal power struggles and external pressures."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nhà Trần, the later Vietnamese dynasty succeeding the Lý."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Trần dynasty established after the power transition orchestrated by Trần Thủ Độ."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vietnamese dynasty succeeding the Lý; part of the Lý–Trần–Hồ era (approx. 12th–14th centuries)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vương triều Trần, triều đại cai trị Đại Việt cho đến thời kỳ suy vong được nhắc đến trong văn bản."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Trần dynasty, whose authority was manipulated by Hồ Quý Ly in the late 14th century."</data>
