    <node id="&quot;TRẦN THỦ ĐỘ&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"1224"&lt;SEP&gt;"Regent who orchestrated the deposition of Lý Huệ Tông and placed Lý Chiêu Hoàng on the throne."&lt;SEP&gt;"The chief minister who orchestrated the power transition, forced Lý Huệ Tông to become a monk, and arranged the marriage between Lý Chiêu Hoàng and Trần Cảnh to establish the Trần dynasty."&lt;SEP&gt;"Thái sư Trần Thủ Độ, in 1224, forced Lý Huệ Tông to abdicate and placed Lý Chiêu Hoàng on the throne."&lt;SEP&gt;"Thái sư who orchestrated the 1224 succession, arranged Chiêu Hoàng- Trần Cảnh marriage, and helped establish the Trần dynasty."&lt;SEP&gt;"Thái sư who orchestrated the abdication of Lý Huệ Tông and the enthronement of Lý Chiêu Hoàng."&lt;SEP&gt;"Grand chancellor who orchestrated the forced abdication of Lý Huệ Tông and installation of Lý Chiêu Hoàng."&lt;SEP&gt;"Regent who consolidated power for the Trần dynasty by orchestrating the abdication of Lý Huệ Tông, arranging the marriage between Lý Chiêu Hoàng and Trần Cảnh, and overseeing the throne transfer to Trần Cảnh."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c4943e96cb569799b168fc03f9b7f0d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-277e0e3e66eb14031c1d448dfa63e42c</data>
