      <data key="d1">"Ming Dynasty of China; considered intervening in Đại Việt; Mạc Đăng Dung submitted homage to maintain peace."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ming Dynasty of China; referenced as a potential intervening power to restore peace."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ming dynasty, whose occupation of parts of Vietnam preceded the rise of the Lê."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nhà Minh, đế chế Trung Hoa xâm lược Đại Ngu vào năm 1407 và sáp nhập Đại Ngu vào lãnh thổ Minh."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ming Dynasty of China, adversaries in the Lam Sơn uprising."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ming dynasty of China that opposed the Lam Sơn uprising."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ming dynasty of China; mentioned as a potential intervening power, symbolically appeased by Mạc Đăng Dung's surrender to maintain peace."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ming dynasty of China; referenced as a potential mediator that Mạc Đăng Dung sought to appease to maintain peace.&lt;SEP&gt;"Ming dynasty of China; Ming court received Mạc Đăng Dung in a symbolic surrender to maintain peace."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ming dynasty; occupied Đại Việt for a short period in the 15th century."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-dab4a6d06213a3107d9e1ca29469f707&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1095d21a9a487ebf90afcd96d02737d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-561d10717f3ff788e1032021a4cf0614&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6033ac15f370150074084b2248ba04f3</data>
      <data key="d3">1407</data>
      <data key="d4">MING DYNASTY&lt;SEP&gt;NHÀ MINH</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MẠC ĐĂNG DOANH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Con trai của Mạc Đăng Dung, được kế vị ngôi vua sau khi cha nhường ngôi và lui về làm Thái Thượng hoàng; nhân vật trung gian trong sự chuyển giao quyền lực của Nhà Mạc."&lt;SEP&gt;"Son of Mạc Đăng Dung who ascended to the throne of the Mạc dynasty after his father’s abdication.&lt;SEP&gt;"Son of Mạc Đăng Dung who succeeded him as ruler."&lt;SEP&gt;"Son of Mạc Đăng Dung; inherited the throne after his father abdicated."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-dab4a6d06213a3107d9e1ca29469f707</data>
      <data key="d3">1529</data>
      <data key="d4">MẠC ĐĂNG DOANH</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NGUYỄN UÔNG&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Anh trai của Nguyễn Kim; được nhắc đến trong cuộc nội chiến Nam–Bắc triều và sự phục dựng vương triều Lê."&lt;SEP&gt;"Older brother of Nguyễn Hoàng; referenced as the elder brother whose fate is used to illustrate why Nguyễn Hoàng feared Trịnh Kiểm's actions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Older brother of Nguyễn Hoàng; mentioned as Nguyễn Hoàng's elder brother in the Nguyễn–Lê–Mạc power dynamics."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-dab4a6d06213a3107d9e1ca29469f707</data>
      <data key="d3" />
      <data key="d4">NGUYỄN UÔNG</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TRỊNH TẠC&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A Trịnh lord who finally eliminated the last Mạc presence by 1677.&lt;SEP&gt;"Chúa Trịnh, chỉ huy quân sự tiêu diệt căn cứ cuối cùng của Nhà Mạc tại Cao Bằng và chấm dứt sự cát cứ ở miền Bắc (1677)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Trịnh Tạc led counterattacks against Nguyễn, pushing Nguyễn forces back across the Gianh River in 1655, and later pursued peace in 1672."&lt;SEP&gt;"Under Trịnh Tạc's command, Trịnh forces counterattacked in 1655, pushing Nguyễn forces back to the southern bank, and later sought a peace with Nguyễn Phúc Tần."&lt;SEP&gt;"Military leader who defeated the final Mạc base in Cao Bằng in 1677."&lt;SEP&gt;"Trịnh Tạc is the 'vị chúa mới' whose rule followed Trịnh Tráng; under his command the Trịnh forces countered Nguyễn and by 1655 had pushed Nguyễn forces back to the southern bank, later leading to ceasefire and negotiations with Nguyễn Phúc Tần.""&lt;SEP&gt;"Dưới sự chỉ huy của Trịnh Tạc, quân Trịnh đã phản công đẩy lùi quân Nguyễn về bờ Nam vào năm 1655."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7da10df4c22499f6e1fbebde9e539db2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dab4a6d06213a3107d9e1ca29469f707</data>
      <data key="d3">1655&lt;SEP&gt;1655"&lt;SEP&gt;1677</data>
      <data key="d4">TRỊNH TẠC</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CHÚA TRỊNH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Chúa Trịnh is the northern feudal lord who led the Trịnh family in Đàng Ngoài during the Trịnh–Nguyễn partition."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ruler of the Trịnh Lords in the north; rival power to Tây Sơn during the period."&lt;SEP&gt;"Trịnh lord, ruler in Đàng Ngoài."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vị chúa cai trị vùng đất phía Bắc trong thời kỳ Trịnh–Nguyễn; tên gọi thường dùng để chỉ người đứng đầu gia tộc Trịnh."&lt;SEP&gt;"Northern Vietnam ruler associated with the Trịnh–Nguyễn era."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Trịnh rulers, the northern power in the Trịnh–Nguyễn conflict era.&lt;SEP&gt;"The title used by the Trịnh lords who ruled in the northern Đàng Ngoài during the Trịnh–Nguyễn feud."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chúa Trịnh is the royal title used for the Trịnh lords who governed Đàng Ngoài during the Trịnh–Nguyễn phân tranh."&lt;SEP&gt;"Northern Vietnamese lord; ruler associated with the Đàng Ngoài region."&lt;SEP&gt;"Northern rulers who held de facto power during the Trịnh–Nguyễn period (1600–1777)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chúa Trịnh, a northern Vietnamese ruler whose conflicts with the Nguyễn lords shaped the era."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ruler of the Trịnh family who controlled the Bắc (north) after the Lê–Mạc conflict."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ruling title used by the Trịnh lords who wielded political and military power in Đàng Ngoài during the Trịnh–Nguyễn feud."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5fca97c72fe1e0e81ac8addb98deb7b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7da10df4c22499f6e1fbebde9e539db2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ca8856a3c05c7e29106b40dae03794b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dab4a6d06213a3107d9e1ca29469f707</data>
      <data key="d3" />
      <data key="d4">""**&lt;SEP&gt;CHÚA TRỊNH&lt;SEP&gt;TRỊNH&lt;SEP&gt;TRỊNH LORDS</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CHÚA NGUYỄN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Chúa Nguyễn is the Nguyễn lord who controlled Đàng Trong and opposed the Trịnh in the Trịnh–Nguyễn partition."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nguyễn lord, ruler in Đàng Trong."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ruler of the Nguyễn lords over Đàng Trong (the southernVietnam region) during the late 18th century; central figure in the Nguyễn dynasty's resistance against Tây Sơn."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vị lãnh tụ cai trị Đàng Trong, đối tác đối đầu với Chúa Trịnh trong thời kỳ phân tranh."&lt;SEP&gt;"Southern Vietnam ruler; the Nguyễn lords."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Nguyễn lords ruled Đàng Trong and were the ruling dynasty opposed by Tây Sơn, whose policies and taxation contributed to the rebellion."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Nguyễn lords who ruled Đàng Trong (the southern realm) during the Trịnh–Nguyễn period."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Nguyễn lords who vied for power with the Trịnh in central-southern Vietnam during the Trịnh–Nguyễn period.&lt;SEP&gt;"Chúa Nguyễn is the royal title used for the Nguyễn lords who governed Đàng Trong and resisted Trịnh domination during the Trịnh–Nguyễn phân tranh."&lt;SEP&gt;"Southern Vietnamese lord; Nguyễn rulers who expanded south."&lt;SEP&gt;"Southern rulers (Nguyễn lords) during the Trịnh–Nguyễn period."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chúa Nguyễn, the Nguyễn lord who expanded southward and solidified control in Đàng Trong."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ruler of the Nguyễn Lords who governed Đàng Trong in the south; counterpart to the Trịnh in the north."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ruling title used by the Nguyễn lords governing Đàng Trong, asserting autonomy from the Trịnh."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5fca97c72fe1e0e81ac8addb98deb7b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7da10df4c22499f6e1fbebde9e539db2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ca8856a3c05c7e29106b40dae03794b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dab4a6d06213a3107d9e1ca29469f707</data>
      <data key="d3" />
      <data key="d4">""**&lt;SEP&gt;CHÚA NGUYỄN&lt;SEP&gt;NGUYỄN&lt;SEP&gt;NGUYỄN LORDS</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ĐÀNG TRONG&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Khu vực Nam Việt do Nguyễn Phúc Nguyên nắm quyền."&lt;SEP&gt;"One of the two major political regions in Vietnam during the feudal era, separated from Đàng Ngoài."&lt;SEP&gt;"Southern Vietnam during the later feudal period."&lt;SEP&gt;"Southern Vietnam region (historical division)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Territory of the Nguyễn lords; captured by Tây Sơn by 1776."&lt;SEP&gt;"The southern region of Vietnam under Nguyễn lords during the partition."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vùng đất Nam Trung Việt do Nguyễn Hoàng kiểm soát từ 1558, phát triển thành thương cảng mậu dịch quốc tế phồn thịnh."&lt;SEP&gt;"Southern Vietnam region associated with the Nguyễn dynasty."&lt;SEP&gt;"Southern region of Vietnam controlled by the Nguyễn lords."&lt;SEP&gt;"Southern Vietnam, a historical region associated with the Nguyễn lords."&lt;SEP&gt;"Southern domain governed by the Nguyễn lords, including Thuận Hóa and Quảng Nam; became a prosperous international trading port region."&lt;SEP&gt;"Đàng Trong refers to the southern domain ruled by the Nguyễn lords.""&lt;SEP&gt;"Southern Vietnam region during the feudal era, contrasted with Đàng Ngoại."&lt;SEP&gt;"Southern domain under Nguyễn Lords in central Vietnam."&lt;SEP&gt;"The southern region of central Vietnam under Nguyễn lords; the Tây Sơn conflict played out across this area."&lt;SEP&gt;"Đàng Trong refers to the southern domain of Vietnam under the Nguyễn lords."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-6033ac15f370150074084b2248ba04f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ca8856a3c05c7e29106b40dae03794b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dab4a6d06213a3107d9e1ca29469f707&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fca97c72fe1e0e81ac8addb98deb7b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7da10df4c22499f6e1fbebde9e539db2</data>
      <data key="d3" />
      <data key="d4">""**&lt;SEP&gt;ĐÀNG TRONG</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ĐÀNG NGOÀI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Khu vực Bắc Việt do Trịnh Tráng và Trịnh Tùng kiểm soát."&lt;SEP&gt;"Northern Vietnam during the later feudal period."&lt;SEP&gt;"Northern Vietnam region (historical division)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Phía Bắc Đại Việt trong thời kỳ phân tranh tương ứng với trấn đất do các Chúa Trịnh nắm quyền."&lt;SEP&gt;"The northern region of Vietnam under the Trịnh lords during the partition."&lt;SEP&gt;"Northern Vietnam region referenced in historical context of missions and politics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Northern region of Vietnam controlled by the Trịnh lords."&lt;SEP&gt;"Northern Vietnam, a historical region mentioned in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"One of the two major political regions in Vietnam during the feudal era, separated from Đàng Trong."&lt;SEP&gt;"Đàng Ngoài refers to the northern domain ruled by the Trịnh lords.""&lt;SEP&gt;"Northern Vietnam region during the feudal era, contrasted with Đàng Trong."&lt;SEP&gt;"Đàng Ngoài refers to the northern realm in historical Vietnam, contrasted with Đàng Trong."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-dab4a6d06213a3107d9e1ca29469f707&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fca97c72fe1e0e81ac8addb98deb7b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7da10df4c22499f6e1fbebde9e539db2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6033ac15f370150074084b2248ba04f3</data>
      <data key="d3" />
      <data key="d4">""**&lt;SEP&gt;ĐÀNG NGOÀI</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NAM–BẮC TRIỀU&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Civil war between the northern Mạc and southern Lê restoration in Đại Việt.&lt;SEP&gt;"Giai đoạn nội chiến giữa Bắc triều (Mạc) và Nam triều (Lê phục hưng) bắt đầu từ 1527 và kéo dài đến 1592."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-dab4a6d06213a3107d9e1ca29469f707</data>
      <data key="d3">1527–1592</data>
      <data key="d4">NAM–BẮC TRIỀU</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THỜI ĐẠI KHÁM PHÁ&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Age of Exploration; Western merchants and missionaries began arriving in Vietnam.&lt;SEP&gt;"Giai đoạn mở rộng giao thương và tiếp xúc với phương Tây; nhóm đầu tiên là người Bồ Đào Nha đến Việt Nam từ năm 1533."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Age of Exploration, during which Western merchants and missionaries began arriving in Vietnam."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-dab4a6d06213a3107d9e1ca29469f707</data>
      <data key="d3" />
      <data key="d4">THỜI ĐẠI KHÁM PHÁ</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THIẾT LẬP QUAN HỆ BANG GIAO NHẬT BẢN-VIỆT NAM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Quan hệ bang giao giữa Nhật Bản và Việt Nam được thiết lập vào năm 1591."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-dab4a6d06213a3107d9e1ca29469f707</data>
      <data key="d3" />
      <data key="d4">THIẾT LẬP QUAN HỆ BANG GIAO NHẬT BẢN-VIỆT NAM</data>
    </node>
