    <node id="&quot;SÀI GÒN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">""&lt;SEP&gt;"Capital of the State of Vietnam and later the Việt Nam Cộng hòa in the South."&lt;SEP&gt;"City attacked by the French expedition in 1859, part of the Nam Kỳ operations.""&lt;SEP&gt;"Former name of Ho Chi Minh City; renamed in 1976."&lt;SEP&gt;"Southern Vietnam area mentioned in the expansion context."&lt;SEP&gt;"Southern Vietnamese city; Nguyễn Ánh consolidates control there; Bá Đa Lộc dies there in 1799."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sài Gòn là thủ đô/điểm tập kết của VNCH, nơi kết thúc chiến tranh với sự sụp đổ của VNCH."&lt;SEP&gt;"Thủ đô của Quốc gia Việt Nam."&lt;SEP&gt;"1940"&lt;|"City that served as a hub for uprising activities and arrests."&lt;SEP&gt;"1940"&lt;|"Major city in southern Vietnam; central to uprising activities and arrests."&lt;SEP&gt;"Capital of South Vietnam; capital of VNCH."&lt;SEP&gt;"City in South Vietnam; noted as the site of the regime's collapse in 1975."&lt;SEP&gt;"City in southern Vietnam; around the Mekong Delta; site of Nguyễn expansion and control of lands in the region."&lt;SEP&gt;"Old name for the city later renamed."&lt;SEP&gt;"Southern Vietnamese city; Bá Đa Lộc died here in 1799; later a site for fortifications built by Puymanel."&lt;SEP&gt;"The city where arrests occurred during the crackdown."&lt;SEP&gt;"Capital city of the South; the VNCH government was based here."&lt;SEP&gt;"Capital city of the State of Vietnam established in 1949."&lt;SEP&gt;"Capital of the South; renamed to Thành phố Hồ Chí Minh in 1976."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chương trình hoạt động và bắt giữ diễn ra tại thành phố Sài Gòn."&lt;SEP&gt;"City in southern Vietnam that fell at the end of the war; the fall marks the end of VNCH."&lt;SEP&gt;"City where Bá Đa Lộc died in 1799."&lt;SEP&gt;"Saigon, historic southern Vietnamese city captured during French conquests."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sài Gòn (Saigon), a major urban center in southern Vietnam mentioned in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sài Gòn (Saigon), the city where the Nam Kỳ uprising planning was exposed."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sài Gòn (Saigon), the city where the plan was exposed and French authorities prepared for action."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sài Gòn refers to the same city as Gia Định (the text presents the equivalence in parentheses)."&lt;SEP&gt;"1949"&lt;|"Capital city designated for the State of Vietnam."&lt;SEP&gt;"Capital of South Vietnam; name of the city before unification; renamed to Thành phố Hồ Chí Minh in 1976."&lt;SEP&gt;"Capital of Việt Nam Cộng hòa; southern capital."&lt;SEP&gt;"Center of Nam Kỳ activities; site of arrests and uprisings."&lt;SEP&gt;"City formerly known as Sài Gòn; được đổi tên thành Thành phố Hồ Chí Minh vào năm 1976."&lt;!-- alias of Thành phố Hồ Chí Minh --&gt;"&lt;SEP&gt;"City in southern Vietnam where the uprising's plans were exposed and French authorities prepared to suppress the uprising."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fall of Saigon; the South Vietnamese government collapsed."&lt;SEP&gt;"South Vietnamese city Saigon; site of early French attack in 1859."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sài Gòn, region in the south targeted during Nguyễn expansion."&lt;SEP&gt;"The major city around which the uprising activities and meetings occurred."&lt;SEP&gt;"A major city in southern Vietnam used as a base for Japanese naval operations; mentioned as part of campaigns."&lt;SEP&gt;"City where delegations went to urge uprising."&lt;SEP&gt;"City where the power transfer, symbolic pledge, and protests occur."&lt;SEP&gt;"Southern Vietnamese city where mass gatherings occurred around the independence events."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-0e1e11930ab01fb061749acffe85b755&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65a62981dbf13b2b72920ca1960170b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88c2283fe59c1e2798b0a0aafedc3142&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18d8e97a0e4680cead04b467abbaf21b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf0b29bf76d345dfa9da0349d9f546d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e0d2b12d6dc3ace3b2354166252a164&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4549a0a33a97f39084dfcd2d857e18f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3e2d86a8a15344ff5c25829117f928c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3f9c5b331f58bfebf51e7a9e8de7972&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3bfa206adeee22a1ede2ef2ae0ad9711&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3692b44304ff5da1927dfcb9ab90461&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fca97c72fe1e0e81ac8addb98deb7b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ebc4b0a454e2ea3adc019759de704c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c715893072e90e3f1536ec249629f939&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-750f8e96d1bcbbd9a06d573268723339</data>
      <data key="d3">1799&lt;SEP&gt;1859"&lt;SEP&gt;1940&lt;SEP&gt;1940"&lt;SEP&gt;1945&lt;SEP&gt;1949&lt;SEP&gt;1954"&lt;SEP&gt;1975&lt;SEP&gt;1976</data>
      <data key="d4">""**&lt;SEP&gt;GIA ĐỊNH&lt;SEP&gt;SAI GON&lt;SEP&gt;SAIGON&lt;SEP&gt;SÀI GÒN&lt;SEP&gt;THÀNH PHỐ HỒ CHÍ MINH</data>
    </node>
