      <data key="d1">""&lt;SEP&gt;"Leader of the Tây Sơn before Nguyễn Huệ; ceded the throne to Quang Trung and became Tây Sơn vương."&lt;SEP&gt;"Leader of the Tây Sơn uprising."&lt;SEP&gt;"Leader of the Tây Sơn movement; historically recognized as Thái Đức Hoàng đế, who eventually handed the throne to Nguyễn Huệ (Quang Trung)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Leader of the Tây Sơn rebellion."&lt;SEP&gt;"Leader of the Tây Sơn uprising."&lt;SEP&gt;"Leader of the Tây Sơn movement; the initial leader of the Tây Sơn, also known as Thái Đức Hoàng đế, who later abdicated in favor of Quang Trung and became Tây Sơn vương."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nguyễn Nhạc, one of the three brothers who led the Tây Sơn movement."</data>
