    <node id="&quot;ĐÔNG DƯƠNG&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">""&lt;SEP&gt;"A historic region comprising present-day Vietnam, Laos, and Cambodia under Japanese protection/occupation during WWII."&lt;SEP&gt;"French Indochina region comprising present-day Vietnam, Laos, and Cambodia, where colonial rule and later division occurred."&lt;SEP&gt;"Khu vực Đông Dương, nơi diễn ra các hoạt động thuộc địa của Pháp trong giai đoạn này."&lt;SEP&gt;"Region comprising Vietnam, Laos, and Cambodia; referenced as the broader Indochina region."&lt;SEP&gt;"French Indochina region referenced in the text; historical colonial territory combining Vietnam, Laos, and Cambodia under French control."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Indochina region under French Vichy rule in the historical context."&lt;SEP&gt;"French Indochina region in Southeast Asia during the colonial era."&lt;SEP&gt;"Đông Dương is the historical geographic region in Southeast Asia that includes present-day Vietnam, Laos, and Cambodia."&lt;SEP&gt;"Alternate name for Liên bang Đông Dương."&lt;SEP&gt;"Geographic region of French Indochina in Southeast Asia."&lt;SEP&gt;"Indochina region involved in the postwar power struggles."&lt;SEP&gt;"Indochina; region comprising present-day Vietnam, Laos, and Cambodia under colonial rule mentioned in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"Đông Dương là khu vực địa lý ở Đông Nam Á, có vai trò lịch sử liên quan đến sự đô hộ và các liên kết khu vực."&lt;SEP&gt;"Indochina region referenced in the context of Japanese surrender and Allied actions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Indochina region under contest and occupation during the period."&lt;SEP&gt;"Indochina region where the events unfold; used to frame the wartime context of Vietnam’s struggle for independence."&lt;SEP&gt;"Region of French Indochina where Japanese influence and wartime administration are discussed in the text."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-bf0b29bf76d345dfa9da0349d9f546d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c3c3dccc1bdcf6bd8ef4c192da6a818&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3e2d86a8a15344ff5c25829117f928c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3f9c5b331f58bfebf51e7a9e8de7972&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3bfa206adeee22a1ede2ef2ae0ad9711&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6322ad53528ea4e193eaf9be34d2898&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ebc4b0a454e2ea3adc019759de704c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43ffd57cec3dd07166a619a76148c755&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b60881720494b2801d1866f2d58b8eb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c715893072e90e3f1536ec249629f939&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3bcac0a2ed12c8c14d19b01dcb829b2f</data>
      <data key="d3">1887&lt;SEP&gt;1945&lt;SEP&gt;1945"</data>
      <data key="d4">INDOCHINA&lt;SEP&gt;ĐÔNG DƯƠNG</data>
    </node>
