      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Chính quyền Pháp Vichy được Nhật Bản bảo hộ tại Đông Dương trong thời kỳ chiến tranh."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pháp Vichy was the French government during World War II that maintained colonial administration in Indochina as a puppet regime."&lt;SEP&gt;"The collaborationist French government (Vichy regime) administering parts of France and its colonies during WWII.""&lt;SEP&gt;"The Vichy French regime governing parts of Indochina during the Japanese occupation in 1945."&lt;SEP&gt;"The French Vichy government that ruled parts of France and its empire during World War II, mentioned as the ruling authority displaced by the Japanese coup."&lt;SEP&gt;"The French Vichy regime that administered Indochina during WWII."</data>
