    <node id="&quot;TẠ THU THÂU&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Leader associated with the Trotskyist movement in Indochina during the late 1920s–1930s."&lt;SEP&gt;"Leader of Trotskyist Trotskyist movement in Vietnam; led Trotskyist faction around the 1920s–1930s.""&lt;SEP&gt;"Tạ Thu Thâu was the leader of the Trotskyist Trotskyist-influenced movement (Trots‑kit) mentioned as guiding the Trotskyist movement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tạ Thu Thâu là một nhà cách mạng cánh tả và lãnh đạo Trotskyist ở Việt Nam thời kỳ đầu."</data>
