      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Bến Ngự (Huế) was the place where Phan Bội Châu was detained until his death in 1940."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bến Ngự, a place in Huế where Phan Bội Châu was placed under house arrest.""&lt;SEP&gt;"Bến Ngự (Huế), nơi Phan Bội Châu bị giam lỏng."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bến Ngự (Huế), the place where Phan Bội Châu was kept under restraint until his death in 1940."</data>
