    <node id="&quot;VIỆT MINH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">""&lt;SEP&gt;"(Alias) Communist movement leading Vietnamese independence efforts; explicitly described as a communist organization under Stalin's influence."&lt;SEP&gt;"Communist movement; under pressure from Stalin, publicly declared itself as a communist organization."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tổ chức cách mạng Việt Nam lãnh đạo cuộc kháng chiến chống Pháp và hoạt động trong thời kỳ kháng chiến."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vietnamese independence movement that publicly proclaimed itself as a communist organization under Soviet and Chinese influence; played a key role in the Vietnamese struggle for independence."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vietnamese independence movement that is described as officially declaring itself a communist organization."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vietnam’s nationalist/communist movement that led resistance against the French and played a central role in the First Indochina War."&lt;SEP&gt;"Việt Minh, the Vietnamese nationalist and communist movement active during the struggle for independence."&lt;SEP&gt;"Việt Minh, the Vietnamese nationalist and communist movement associated with the period."&lt;SEP&gt;""&lt;|"A Vietnamese nationalist and communist-led independence movement that opposed French colonial rule."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Vietnamese revolutionary organization listed among major movements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Independence movement led by Hồ Chí Minh; central to the August 1945 events."&lt;SEP&gt;"Resistance organization led by the Communist Party during World War II; collaborated with OSS."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vietnamese nationalist independence front; represented by Hồ Chí Minh in the declaration of independence."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vietnamese nationalist independence movement; precursor to the VNDCCH government."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Vietnamese nationalist revolutionary organization leading the independence movement; referenced as the Việt Minh and its central body (Tổng bộ Việt Minh) and as the publisher of the Việt Minh newspaper Cứu quốc."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Vietnamese revolutionary organization formed in May 1941 as Việt Nam Độc lập Đồng minh to fight for Vietnamese independence from colonial rule and Japanese occupation; commonly referred to as Việt Minh."&lt;SEP&gt;"Independence movement and political organization central to the abdication and independence events; represented by figures like Trần Huy Liệu at the ceremony."&lt;SEP&gt;"Popular front/coalition-led movement that organized the August Revolution; includes the liberation struggle and political leadership."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Vietnamese independence movement that leads the August 1945 uprising and the transfer of power."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vietnamese nationalist and communist political/military front active during the period."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vietnamese nationalist independence movement that spearheaded the push for independence in 1945, mobilizing broad popular support and playing a key role in resisting occupiers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Việt Minh is a communist-led nationalist front that fought Japanese forces in Thái Nguyên and became the central force in Vietnam's struggle for independence, mobilizing broad popular support over years."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-18d8e97a0e4680cead04b467abbaf21b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf0b29bf76d345dfa9da0349d9f546d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c3c3dccc1bdcf6bd8ef4c192da6a818&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e0d2b12d6dc3ace3b2354166252a164&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3f9c5b331f58bfebf51e7a9e8de7972&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3bfa206adeee22a1ede2ef2ae0ad9711&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fff36ca9411ec2bf48b0a366dd7589f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0858721f576cf19954031c342a7d2bff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6322ad53528ea4e193eaf9be34d2898&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dae09351baefd2c96da656733c534ccd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ebc4b0a454e2ea3adc019759de704c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b60881720494b2801d1866f2d58b8eb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c715893072e90e3f1536ec249629f939</data>
      <data key="d3">1941&lt;SEP&gt;1941"&lt;SEP&gt;1945&lt;SEP&gt;1945"&lt;SEP&gt;1946&lt;SEP&gt;1950"</data>
      <data key="d4">ETSUMEI&lt;SEP&gt;MẶT TRẬN VIỆT MINH&lt;SEP&gt;TỔNG BỘ VIỆT MINH&lt;SEP&gt;VIET MINH&lt;SEP&gt;VIỆT MINH&lt;SEP&gt;VIỆT NAM ĐỘC LẬP ĐỒNG MINH</data>
    </node>
