    <node id="&quot;NAM KỲ KHỞI NGHĨA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"1940"&lt;&gt;"A large-scale uprising across 18 provinces in Southern Vietnam that began on the night of 22 November 1940 and continued into early 1941."&lt;SEP&gt;"A large-scale rebellion across southern Vietnam (Nam Kỳ) that began on 22–23 November 1940, involving multiple provinces and urban centers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nam Kỳ khởi nghĩa là cuộc nổi dậy vũ trang chống Pháp và Nhật của người dân Nam Kỳ vào năm 1940, do Xứ ủy Nam Kỳ của Đảng Cộng sản Đông Dương chủ trương và lãnh đạo."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nam Kỳ khởi nghĩa was a large-scale uprising in southern Vietnam against French colonial rule; although ultimately crushed, it embodied courageous resistance and marked a significant moment in Vietnam's struggle for independence."&lt;SEP&gt;"A major anti-French uprising in southern Vietnam involving protests, pamphlet distribution, strikes, and guerrilla actions against the French colonial authorities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nam Kỳ khởi nghĩa is the armed uprising in southern Vietnam (Nam Kỳ) against French and Japanese rule in 1940, organized and led by the Xứ ủy Nam Kỳ of the Indochina Communist Party (Đảng Cộng sản Đông Dương)."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Nam Kỳ uprising spanning from Biên Hòa to Cà Mau, involving guerrilla actions across 18 provinces starting on the night of 22–23 November 1940."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7e0d2b12d6dc3ace3b2354166252a164&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65a62981dbf13b2b72920ca1960170b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-750f8e96d1bcbbd9a06d573268723339</data>
      <data key="d3">1940&lt;SEP&gt;1940"</data>
      <data key="d4">KHỞI NGHĨA NAM KỲ&lt;SEP&gt;NAM KỲ KHOI NGHIA&lt;SEP&gt;NAM KỲ KHỞI NGHĨA</data>
    </node>
