    <node id="&quot;VIỆT NAM TUYÊN TRUYỀN GIẢI PHÓNG QUÂN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A 34-person unit formed by Võ Nguyên Giáp; one of the precursors of the Vietnamese People's Army."&lt;SEP&gt;"A unit founded by Võ Nguyên Giáp that is one of the precursors of the Vietnamese People's Army."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Viet Nam Tuyên truyền Giải phóng quân is the Vietnamese revolutionary force that conducted the December 1944 attacks against French outposts at Phai Khắt and Nà Ngần; it is also referred to by later sources as Việt Minh or QĐNDVN."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Vietnamese anti-French guerrilla organization that carried out the Phai Khăt and Nà Ngần operations; these were its first two battles."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Vietnamese anti-French guerrilla organization that carried out the Phai Khắt and Nà Ngần operations; these were its first two battles."&lt;SEP&gt;"Việt Nam Tuyên truyền Giải phóng quân, a Vietnamese anti-French military organization."&lt;SEP&gt;"Việt Nam Tuyên truyền Giải phóng quân, anti-French military organization."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vietnamese political-military organization involved in the independence movement."</data>
