    <node id="&quot;XÔ VIẾT NGHỆ TĨNH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Movement named Xô Viết Nghệ Tĩnh; also used as the title of a painting."&lt;SEP&gt;"Soviet-style local government established during the anti-colonial struggle."&lt;SEP&gt;"Soviet‑style local government formed in Nghệ An and Hà Tĩnh by peasants and workers; seized land, grain, and money; aimed to replace colonial/feudal authorities; ultimately suppressed."&lt;SEP&gt;"Xô Viết Nghệ Tĩnh is the movement of workers and peasants in Nghệ An and Hà Tĩnh during the revolutionary upsurge of 1930–1931 against French colonial rule. It is associated with the formation of early revolutionary administrations at the local level, often called Xô viết."&lt;SEP&gt;"Xô viết Nghệ Tĩnh, Soviet-style local councils in Nghệ Tĩnh during the era."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7e0d2b12d6dc3ace3b2354166252a164&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd3c75fb34fd08ca28a6bdea4defc0f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa6f1c379fafd63c9e5491579d159fc0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0468eaa8e1dded2ae27a39363308b486</data>
