    <node id="&quot;CÁCH MẠNG THÁNG TÁM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"August Revolution that led to the establishment of the Provisional Government and independence movement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cách mạng tháng tám (August Revolution) of 1945 in Vietnam."&lt;SEP&gt;"The August Revolution (1945), referenced as part of the historical sequence following Nam Kỳ uprising."&lt;SEP&gt;"The August Revolution (Cách mạng tháng Tám), also called the General Uprising of August, was the Vietnamese event in 1945 when Việt Minh carried out an uprising against the Japanese Empire, forcing the Đế quốc Việt Nam to hand over central and local government and prompting Bao Đại to abdicate in August 1945."&lt;SEP&gt;"The August Revolution, which led to Vietnam's independence in 1945."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-0858721f576cf19954031c342a7d2bff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e0d2b12d6dc3ace3b2354166252a164&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18d8e97a0e4680cead04b467abbaf21b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c3c3dccc1bdcf6bd8ef4c192da6a818</data>
      <data key="d3">1945</data>
      <data key="d4">CÁCH MẠNG THÁNG TÁM&lt;SEP&gt;TỔNG KHỞI NGHĨA THÁNG TÁM</data>
    </node>
