    <node id="&quot;PHAI KHẮT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A village and site of a French outpost in Tam Kim commune, Nguyên Bình district, Cao Bằng province; attacked by Viet Minh in December 1944."&lt;SEP&gt;"Làng Phai Khắt is a village in xã Tam Kim, huyện Nguyên Bình, tỉnh Cao Bằng; it is the site involved in the Phai Khăt operation and where the French fort stationed there was attacked by Viet Nam Tuyên truyền Giải phóng quân."</data>
