      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Commander of Việt Minh's Liberation Army; commanded units attacking Japanese posts."&lt;SEP&gt;"General Võ Nguyên Giáp who organized a 34-man unit named Việt Nam Tuyên truyền Giải phóng quân on December 22, 1944."&lt;SEP&gt;"Minister of Interior in the Provisional Government; gave a formal briefing and spoke during the ceremony."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vietnamese General; his memoirs and military documents are cited for the Nà Ngần operation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vietnamese general who personally commanded the Viet Minh forces during the Phai Khắt and Nà Ngần operations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Võ Nguyên Giáp founded Việt Nam Tuyên truyền Giải phóng quân on 22 December 1944 and led its initial actions against the Japanese."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-18d8e97a0e4680cead04b467abbaf21b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c3c3dccc1bdcf6bd8ef4c192da6a818&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7418e6f1b899c505272caee02f3cf1ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3bfa206adeee22a1ede2ef2ae0ad9711&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0858721f576cf19954031c342a7d2bff</data>
