      <data key="d5">24.0</data>
      <data key="d6">"associated with the Đông Sơn culture and the state of Âu Lạc as part of its historical context"&lt;SEP&gt;"is part of the Đông Sơn cultural sphere that includes Văn Lang, Âu Lạc and Hồng Bàng."&lt;SEP&gt;"Đông Sơn is associated with Âu Lạc as part of the Đông Sơn cultural sphere."</data>
